In many cases it will be important to regularly review your situation and the ongoing suitability of any plans, particularly for investments. Should you agree, TFAS Wealth Limited aims to revisit and review your plans at least annually.
## The service includes:
Review meeting at least once a year and recommendations which may include the following as part of this service; bed and ISA, fund switches, drawdown withdrawals, portfolio rebalance, updated fact find and attitude to risk. *
Statements and Performance Reports twice per year.
Cash flow analysis when relevant and beneficial.
Family benefit where you can have an adviser fee free advice for direct family members for their ISA or pension set up on top of up to three hours advice for your children.
Regular market updates.
Quarterly e-magazine.
On-line access for portfolio valuations.
